{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":7,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":7,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":286,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/avatar.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"}],"family_name":"风仓","given_name":"萌绘","family_name_jp":"風倉","given_name_jp":"モエ","family_name_kr":"카제쿠라","given_name_kr":"모에","family_name_en":"Kazekura","given_name_en":"Moe","family_name_zh_tw":"風倉","given_name_zh_tw":"萌","family_name_cn":"风仓","given_name_cn":"萌绘","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"回收闲置导弹炮弹，有意联系！","main_relation":44,"relation":[43,70],"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":163,"birthday":"09-13","hobby":"燃放烟花","designer":"Mx2J","illustrator":"Mx2J","character_voice":"井泽诗织","character_voice_cn":"杨晨曦","release_date":"2022-08-24","release_date_cn":"2024-04-04","release_date_global":"2023-02-28","school":11,"weapon_type":"HG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":false,"spine":[507,343,178],"model":[102,419],"voice":[{"description":"moe_title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/J2m2XuC3lv0iV0v0lnyNNxTJHaXhgVPi.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里……是不是少了什么重要的发射按钮？","text_original":"何かこう、大事な発射ボタンとか落ちてないもんかねー……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/xDBGa93IPRkJ2vnMw8SxcVlsPYTPwiT1.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"嘻嘻嘻……","text_original":"くひひ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/AIENomPEw7VZNm9vyLaBz2mNiIvmzfAF.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"要不要把这里当成新的据点呢？","text_original":"ここ、新しい拠点にしちゃって良い？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/F7j2I1xeQyseYiqfeoqMEDPF5fCuKn2i.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"……啊，总觉得很安心。","text_original":"……まあ、割と落ち着くかも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/EPHZO0Uux1bln0oQn90a21u9z8kJNp2t.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"糖分要不足了……","text_original":"飴が足りない……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/1qXwEp581m3OHho9dJ82wMy4D4r4UBJ1.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"开火~！","text_original":"Fire！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/GpGTkT8BFPoNSVGUvFiQFESjdxtLJ55v.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"嘻嘻，全弹发射！","text_original":"くひひっ、全弾発射～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/Cypiw2N0TCoYX31zujXetbOHEBONMsUy.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"哼——呵啊——我要忍不住啦！","text_original":"ふう、ふう、もう我慢できない！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/ktVPx78OtqVyJxml73p0PGmAn6jMz1KC.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"咿呀，这种毛骨悚然的快感！","text_original":"いやー、ゾクゾクするね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/XBVbMp8mIcvc12uDIfwH4nKnkCRXPz49.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"好啦，华丽地绽放吧！","text_original":"さあ、派手に行こうか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/uHvbsUOumeAQ1XAzlxaxp984UEQnF3Tz.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"嘻嘻嘻，就是这个最上瘾！","text_original":"くひひっ、これだからやめられな～い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/IFLXCROW2YLWxVzKPRIdHHwPUZJF6TvW.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"哈啊~哈啊~好美啊！","text_original":"はぁ、はぁ、綺麗……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/ZwXNwymVmTPMUVGQGQOPNZRyNZq5HreF.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"RABBIT-224式手枪，收到……呃，怎么这么小，火力够吗？","text_original":"RABBIT-224式拳銃、確かに受け取った。 ……ねぇ、これ結構小さいけど、ちゃんと火力出る？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/cdJF8VnMwTqgMLhri7cH5eITdwE7nMbz.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"怎么啦？怎么啦？我好像闻到了危险的味道！","text_original":"なになに、どこかから危険な匂いがするね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/T1GxI1h9XvwbWvJeF1UbRKDIwIEpRC3j.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"是不是需要我的帮助呀~？","text_original":"私のてつだいが必要って感じ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/gMG4EYN21TcYKF9isCewvS2rsG8pWJVG.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"SRT特种学院，RABBIT小队所属，风仓萌绘前来报到。嘻嘻嘻……后方的支援工作就都交给我吧。","text_original":"SRT特殊学園、RABBIT小隊の風倉モエ。くひひ……支援なら、私に任せて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/nP7utxfNDbiwiAIw06YYjidv6mkMCR4z.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"欸嘿嘿，老师，谢谢你呀~","text_original":"くひひ……サンキュー、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/ogc4tU6yxoH5fkMBBxCdBOHiKczdtVgO.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"还不够，还能继续！","text_original":"もっと、もっとやれるはず…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/LaeMiVLm8DMLMVknBePx5libh1qzQkXY.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"老师，给了我这么多，肚子都撑圆了。","text_original":"先生が色々くれるから、もうお腹一杯だよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/wVR2yX7EIIsOynUIfT6FY21ebmdRReid.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"好兴奋啊，不错，感觉有意思起来了！","text_original":"昂ぶってきた。良いね、楽しくなってきたよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/DzPcOGP5KjK7VzcFPzjc0dPPxtnYRYPS.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"差不多要补充RABBIT小队的备用库存了……","text_original":"そろそろRABBIT小隊の備品でも補充しておくか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/LzV8f6pz1G5Guu6U6NSP57pthqLzIfIP.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊唔……糖分补给可是很重要的，这个我不能让步！","text_original":"はむ……糖分補給は大事っしょ。これは譲ってたまるか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/dw0cHr0z7MX6PyfaFoDo3BLwpNgOUVtt.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"啊……好想吃以前前辈给我做过的稻荷寿司啊。","text_original":"あー……前に先輩が作ってくれた、あのいなり寿司が食べたい気分。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/jkQI0F1inREuA4dLNvhN1DesHGqqlQQR.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"真是的，为什么糖果不算最基本的补给品呢？ 对于我们通信员来说，糖分就是燃料啊！","text_original":"全く、どうして基本的な補給品として飴をカウントしちゃいけないんだ？ 糖分はオペレーターにとって、燃料みたいなもんなのに","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/eRI3wRhdBy0q9wNgcSI94AXyxiE7fxyU.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"工作看起来很忙嘛，需要我帮把手吗？ 哎呀，就交给我试试吧。嘻嘻嘻……","text_original":"仕事、忙しそうじゃん。手伝ってあげようか？ まぁ、任せてみなって。くひひ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/HDJL0h7eLgExw68yRfQb088Dwrqpretp.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师欢迎回来。你今天也是老样子啊，还是那么忙，嘻嘻嘻……","text_original":"ああ、お帰り先生。今日も相変わらず忙しそうだね、くひひ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/xwsH1DVetx9AQBbhMvU6m3Gl2kdWi6D3.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"噢，这不是老师吗？最近一直很忙的样子嘛。","text_original":"お、先生じゃん。なーんかずっと忙しそうだね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/YARvIHlHVlBiAPywyuRJFRY0V9qQIiXD.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师啊……这个世界上有着各种各样的禁忌。比如不能按下的按钮，比如不能越过的那条线……","text_original":"先生……世の中には色んなものがあるでしょ。 押しちゃいけないボタンとか、超えちゃダメな一線とか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/ynYdVGUnwt0MjqAyITduNhzxD8lxL3w9.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"在这些禁忌里，有些一旦被打破，就会导致毁灭，再也无法回头。","text_original":"中には、一度選んだら取り返しのつかない、破滅に繋がるようなものもある。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/PKbpv99XOkqxIx4TwRJvdrnFijPlEUJ4.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"只要走错一步就会坠入深渊 。但如果，你能因此满足自己内心的欲望……","text_original":"一歩間違えたら終わり、それでも自分の心を満足させられるかもしれない……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/zFkYHLLnHwLYV0upEH9gGOYRmC3ih9Lw.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"这种时候……老师会怎么做？","text_original":"そんな時、先生はどうする？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/IqdFLt3WiqNwH6wtRPOxZkv7UdD0Hjki.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我也知道这个问题没什么意义。毕竟老师是个规矩人嘛。","text_original":"無意味な質問だってことは分かってるよ。先生は真面目だしね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/brgsjTZ6OXNTM3VLCvsTbhQcAyIFuVxF.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"可是我就不一样了，我可能会越过那条线。","text_original":"でも私は……その一線を、超えちゃうかもしれない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/UAAAcmpHob2UfAdBAv9p2AYnHsS74KaQ.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为迎来毁灭的那个瞬间，正是我证明自己的机会。","text_original":"だってその破滅の瞬間は、私自身を証明できる機会でもある。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/gx4qyu5e1Fo2EQjq1J9Edw5S9Dr6goW2.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"所以，老师……","text_original":"だから、先生……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/mH5idfUXPdAifyB6L8GQbmtC9JsoQXxA.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"你愿意……和我一起，越过那条线吗？","text_original":"その一線……私と一緒に、超えてみない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/ZUniFnCWRWGCGYuEdCgtRE2XPmJJjw5W.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"感觉老师一直在帮助我呢，欸嘿嘿~","text_original":"なんだか先生には、いっつも助けてもらってばかりな気がするね。くひひ…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/bsObtOrwKRP9GI3gQoSlMmck7vzUCZ56.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"总觉得……好像要越界了。","text_original":"な～んかこう、一線を超えそうな感じ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/YCLtFEyFCELzZQtL4UKtAksDmy5RDgPw.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"要吃糖吗？虽然我全都舔过了。","text_original":"飴、いる？私の食べかけしかないけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/dLAxRDv52Qij3HkLU706D3Q1nMLnRuLd.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"只要和老师在一起，就算迎来华丽的毁灭也……呼嘿嘿~","text_original":"先生と一緒なら、ド派手な破滅を迎えるのも……くひひ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/I2CVZPwecENUBmK4XqL8joLNm60RuzOf.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"生日蛋糕？啊不用，给我一发盛大的烟花就好了…… 嗯，难得有机会，就找老师要一个超级华丽的……嘻嘻嘻。","text_original":"誕生日ケーキ？いや別に、私には花火さえあればそれで……。 そうだね、どうせならド派手で強烈なのを……くひひ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/1O8jnXkVPCtg9h260AOxi3BB5U607J6S.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。那么…… 要来一发华丽的生日烟花吗？","text_original":"誕生日おめでと、先生。ってことで…… 一発派手に、お祝いの花火とかどう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/HjuUXmSixVV3h8hdvIT6WFRmfjnZffzP.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"这个南瓜灯……要是给它撒上白磷粉，一定会燃烧得更漂亮吧…… 哈啊，哈啊……","text_original":"このカボチャのランタン……あの粉をかけたらもっと綺麗に燃えそうじゃん…… はあ、はあ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/vUALIIAC23oRnLFU168dVfHH2mvBNryJ.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"听说山海经新年有放烟花除旧迎新的风俗…… 这可真是个好风俗呀……嘻嘻嘻。","text_original":"山海経では新年に花火を打ち上げて厄除けをする風習があるらしいよ。 ほんっと、良い文化だねぇ……くひひ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/wDJXp37txwRWnzKGN8Oxq6Qe0yU85ofM.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"今年圣诞节，我们RABBIT小队的队员要一起吃火鸡。 嗯？当然是在我们一直待的那个公园里吃呀。","text_original":"今年のクリスマスは、RABBIT小隊全員で七面鳥を食べることになってさ。 ん？もちろんいつもの公園でだよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/i2zoRa3Y9sQsDyWTclr5fJLhl2vkkacI.ogg"},{"description":"Moe_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？消防安全法……？那是什么？","text_original":"ん？消防法……？なにそれ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/vZZjeVme8LJz1xmunnboEJr4nkO4z3te.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"moe_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"……啊，总觉得很安心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/ADruUmbxRE8kaTDXXZjvPp2opUwg7pn9.ogg"},{"description":"moe_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"糖分要不足了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/xUMz6JiyXKunqjwwa9K2JMsIR0eWJnrg.ogg"},{"description":"moe_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"开火~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/eAiOFRICeW8CnMKvoRtuC1cZAp2NU5W1.ogg"},{"description":"moe_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"嘻嘻，全弹发射！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%A3%8E%E4%BB%93%20%E8%90%8C%E7%BB%98/WIH9WWSpTRGRrFOMMCyvVHn3GcZwPiPT.ogg"},{"description":"moe_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"哼——呵啊——我要忍不住啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/stu